        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "(iii) we have significant refining and logistics assets, we are the largest refiner in Argentina with a processing capacity that represents more than 50% of Argentina’s total refining capacity and operates with high utilization rates, and our refining system is highly complex, which gives us the flexibility to transfer part of our production resources to products with higher added value;",
        "start_character": 166546,
        "end_character": 166936
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we implemented an optimization process along the retail service stations operated by OPESSA, which included a comprehensive review of operations and the transfer of 23 retail service stations to third parties and 2 were left without operation.",
        "start_character": 114868,
        "end_character": 115125
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we work on the definition and development of new energies portfolio.",
        "start_character": 158115,
        "end_character": 158197
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we supplied the fuels that third-parties DAPSA and GULF sell at their 267 retail service stations, representing 3.1% of the total local market.",
        "start_character": 119033,
        "end_character": 119185
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our subsidiary Y-TEC, we are involved in providing research and development services in the field of technology applied to the hydrocarbon industry.",
        "start_character": 157867,
        "end_character": 158023
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are Argentina’s leading refiner, holding more than 50% of the country’s total refining capacity, through our 3 wholly-owned refineries (La Plata, Luján de Cuyo and Plaza Huincul refineries) which have an aggregate refining capacity of 123.4 Mbbl (338.0 kbbl/d) and are strategically located along our crude oil pipeline and refined product pipeline distribution systems near the most important urban centers.",
        "start_character": 89577,
        "end_character": 89988
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We market a wide range of refined petroleum and petrochemical products throughout Argentina through an extensive network of sales personnel, YPF-owned and independent distributors, and a broad retail distribution system.",
        "start_character": 107166,
        "end_character": 107386
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell a significant portion of the crude oil we produce in Argentina to our Midstream and Downstream business segment.",
        "start_character": 85658,
        "end_character": 85778
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We supply products such as fuels (diesel, gasoline, jet fuel and fuel oil), lubricants, coal, asphalts, and derivatives (sulfur, CO2, decanted oil and aromatic extract), either directly from our refineries to the point of consumption through our own ground and waterway network, or through a network of 17 industrial distributors with national coverage (mining, oil and gas and asphalts).",
        "start_character": 118500,
        "end_character": 118888
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While crude oil and natural gas will continue to form the core of our portfolio for the next years (both International Energy Agency Scenarios and internal analysis project that the demand for crude oil and natural gas still offers a window of opportunity until 2050), we will pursue this with a focus on high-value assets, lower carbon-intensity products and by developing energy alternatives, in order to ensure a competitive and resilient business model in different time horizons.",
        "start_character": 205008,
        "end_character": 205492
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Besides, we evolved our “proximity station” (“ECER”, by its acronym in Spanish) model, originally designed for small towns, by introducing ECER+.",
        "start_character": 115681,
        "end_character": 115826
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-126363",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126363-a044b304ef2bf7a1",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126363",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Consequently, by keeping us close to our customers, we developed innovative tailored solutions.",
        "start_character": 117786,
        "end_character": 117881
      }
